  "description": "Min-Hyuk's life takes an unexpected turn when he meets Sun-Woo, a quirky yet irresistibly cute guy he ends up living with by chance. At first, Sun-Woo's antics drive him crazy, but soon, his charm begins to grow on Min-Hyuk. Just as Min-Hyuk starts to enjoy their unusual cohabitation, Sun-woo drops a bombshell confession that turns his world upside down. With his peaceful life in turmoil, Min-Hyuk must navigate his feelings and the unexpected twists that come with living with someone as unpredictable as Sun-Woo. Will he be able to resist Sun-Woo's charms, or is he destined to fall for him?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count contains 3 side story chapters.*",
